1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:07,125
Tot el camp

2
00:00:07,125 --> 00:00:10,250
 és un clam

3
00:00:10,925 --> 00:00:14,350
som la gent blaugrana

4
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:19,075
Tant se val d'on venim

5
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:23,225
si del sud o del nord

6
00:00:23,225 --> 00:00:26,975
Ara estem d'acord, estem d'acord

7
00:00:26,975 --> 00:00:30,200
una bandera ens agermana

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:34,700
Blaugrana al vent

9
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:38,697
un crit valent

10
00:00:38,697 --> 00:00:42,700
Tenim un nom, el sap tothom

11
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:48,625
Barça! Barça! Baaarça!

12
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,883
Jugadors

13
00:00:59,883 --> 00:01:04,150
seguidors

14
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:07,912
tots units fem força

15
00:01:07,912 --> 00:01:11,742
Són molt anys plens d'afanys

16
00:01:11,742 --> 00:01:15,550
són molts gols que hem cridat

17
00:01:15,550 --> 00:01:19,659
I s'ha demostrat, s'ha demostrat

18
00:01:19,659 --> 00:01:23,475
que mai ningú no ens podrà tòrcer

19
00:01:23,475 --> 00:01:27,634
Blaugrana al vent

20
00:01:27,634 --> 00:01:31,125
un crit valent

21
00:01:31,125 --> 00:01:35,225
Tenim un nom, el sap tothom

22
00:01:35,225 --> 00:01:39,950
Barça! Barça! Baaarça!

